# Agent worktrees (the hot-repo convention: `git worktree add .worktrees/<slug>`).
# Untracked, these get swept into a `git add -A`, and a root-level `ruff check .`
# / `ty check .` recurses into every checkout and reports another branch's
# findings as this one's.
.worktrees/
